10
00:08:14,108 --> 00:08:18,808
思いがけず光るのは 海の幽霊
Out of the blue, they glitter: The spirits of the sea.

11
00:09:51,308 --> 00:09:57,808
風薫る 砂浜で また会いましょう
On a beach graced by the fresh summer breeze,
