きっと君だって同じ事
Empty out your mind and then you'll realize.

169
00:22:50,075 --> 00:22:51,615
「ところで一つ伺いますが
If your heart is real...

170
00:22:52,115 --> 00:22:53,605
先日何処かで？…やっぱりいいや」
when you cast it aside, surely you're the same.

171
