189
00:23:37,685 --> 00:23:40,705
立つ鳥跡濁って糞のアート
But it's do or die! Survive insanity!

190
00:23:40,705 --> 00:23:42,805
初めはあんな大層な大言壮語を並べたが
Bitter choco decoration.

191
00:23:42,805 --> 00:23:46,725
嫌々も好きの内
You know that every now and then a "love" will bring you "pain".

192
00:23:46,725 --> 00:23:48,635
「いやはやしかして今日は初めてで
Bitter choco decoration.

193
00:23:48,635 --> 00:23:52,585
こんなとはね 君センスあるよ」
They're gonna leave you far behind, their art forever stained.

194
00:23:52,585 --> 00:23:54,975
恋する季節にビターチョコデコレーション
Way back at the start, with dreams, I could impress.

195
00:23:54,975 --> 00:23:57,475
恋する気持ちでビターチョコデコレーション
Now it's tossed aside, no one cares, no one obsessed.

196
00:23:57,475 --> 00:23:59,505
F.U.C.K.Y.O.U
Sometimes we say no, but we're always meaning yes.

197
