僕は大人にやっとなったよママ
Love in season, give a reason, bitter choco decoration.

200
00:24:08,715 --> 00:24:13,595
明日のひと言のその先も遅刻は続くどこまでも
Love in feeling, give a meaning, bitter choco decoration.

201
