We did various things and talked about various things.

420
00:45:46,327 --> 00:45:48,477
森も行ったしね。
We even went to the woods.

421
00:45:48,767 --> 00:45:51,877
森行ったね。クリスマスに森。
We went to the woods. The woods on Christmas.

422
00:45:51,877 --> 00:45:52,587
そうだね。
That's right.

423
00:45:53,457 --> 00:45:56,577
いや、楽しかったりしちゃったね。
Man, it was actually really fun.

424
00:45:56,577 --> 00:45:57,597
