Ah, then, first, since you sometimes don't answer properly or dodge the question, I want you to tell Sakamata how much you love her.

439
00:47:29,267 --> 00:47:37,927
え、どうしたどうした？なんで、どこに笑う要素あんの？大好きを伝えてほしい。伝えてほしいです。
Eh, what's wrong? Why, where's the funny part? I want you to tell me you love me. I want you to tell me.

440
00:47:39,487 --> 00:47:46,107
やった！言ってよ！言ってよ！わかった、わかった。それでね、まずはって何、待って？
