軋む戸を叩いて
Knocking on the creaking door,

832
01:20:23,174 --> 01:20:25,634
何から話せばいいのか
What should I even talk about first,

833
01:20:25,634 --> 01:20:27,714
分からなくなる
until I don't even know anymore?

834
01:20:27,714 --> 01:20:30,754
星が降る夜に あなたに会えた
In the night when stars fall, I met you.

835
01:20:31,254 --> 01:20:34,814
あの夜を忘れはしない
I will never forget that night.

836
