思いがけず光るのは 海の幽霊
shining bright unexpectedly is a ghost of the sea.

839
01:20:47,730 --> 01:20:49,550
うなだる夏の夕に
In the drooping summer evening,

840
01:20:49,550 --> 01:20:52,170
桟橋を見送る
