842
01:20:54,610 --> 01:20:56,790
花を散らして
scattering flowers.

843
01:21:10,228 --> 01:21:13,408
あなたがどこかで笑う声が聞こえる
I can hear your laughter somewhere,

844
01:21:13,408 --> 01:21:16,388
熱い頬の手触り
the touch of your warm cheek.

845
